  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox vevent\" style=\"font-size: 88%; line-height: 1.5em;\">\n\n<caption class=\"summary\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold\">United States presidential election, 2156\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" title=\"United States\"><img alt=\"United States\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/d/de/Flag_of_the_United_States.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20170818144039\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of the United States.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_the_United_States.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:left;\" class=\"noprint\"><a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2148\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2148\">2148</a>&#160;←<br />\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;\"><b>November 7, 2152</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%;text-align:right;\" class=\"noprint\">→&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/United_States_presidential_election,_2156\" title=\"United States presidential election, 2156\">2156</a><br />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\">\n<table style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><small>All eligible voters who turned out</small><br /><small>51% of votes votes needed to win</small>\n</th></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Turnout\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center\">75.7%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/98/Zaya_Blank.png/revision/latest?cb=20170207190831\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Zaya Blank\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/98/Zaya_Blank.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20170207190831\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Zaya Blank.png\" data-image-key=\"Zaya_Blank.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20150810222433\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Ha-eun_Zaya\" title=\"Ha-eun Zaya\">Ha-eun Zaya</a></b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Roger Moran\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Union\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Conservative\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jupiter\" title=\"Jupiter\">Xibala</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luna\" title=\"Luna\">North Apollo</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>Joaquin Vega</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Yuri Blanco\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>1,500,400,000</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">933,100,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><b>48.4%</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">30.1%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><hr />\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td>&#160;\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150810222433\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Person\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Person.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Person.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/6/6d/Blank_Person.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20150810222433\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest?cb=20151107015223\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blank Woman\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"121\" height=\"147\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blank Woman.png\" data-image-key=\"Blank_Woman.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/4/40/Blank_Woman.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/121?cb=20151107015223\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Nominee\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Dell Cortes\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Halley Roxford\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:75px;text-align:left\">Party\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Progress\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Libertarian\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Home&#160;state\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mars\" title=\"Mars\">Cleopatra</a>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Earth\" title=\"Earth\">Wales</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Running&#160;mate\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Tom Merryl\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">Tesla Jones\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Popular&#160;vote\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">375,100,000\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">328,600,000\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Percentage\n</th>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">12.1%\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:75px;text-align:center\">10.6%\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\"><hr />\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"background:transparent; width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:left; text-size: 80%\"><b>President before election</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ha-eun_Zaya\" title=\"Ha-eun Zaya\">Ha-eun Zaya</a><br />\nUnion\n</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%; text-align:right; text-size: 80%\"><b>Elected President</b><br />\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Ha-eun_Zaya\" title=\"Ha-eun Zaya\">Ha-eun Zaya</a><br />\nUnion\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p><p>The <b>United States presidential election of 2152</b> was the 92nd quadrennial presidential election. Incumbent <a href=\"/wiki/Ha-eun_Zaya\" title=\"Ha-eun Zaya\">Ha-eun Zaya</a> won re-election. Shortly after the election, the Libertarian Party disbanded.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261118065645\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.119 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.136 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2722/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14357/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4111/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 10/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1032015/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  110.553      1 Template:Infobox_election\n100.00%  110.553      1 -total\n 82.69%   91.413      3 Template:Infobox_election/row\n 34.03%   37.620     11 Template:Ifempty\n  6.53%    7.222      6 Template:Infobox_election/shortname\n  5.21%    5.762      1 Template:Flagicon\n  3.86%    4.267      1 Template:Country_data_United_States\n  2.20%    2.432     48 Template:!-\n  2.01%    2.220      1 Template:Flagicon/core\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:1813-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261118065645 and revision id 552